<section aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <h2 id="about-heading">The foundation of a local-first authentication ecosystem.</h2>
  <p>Desktop-2FA provides the desktop secure core: an encrypted local vault, password-based key derivation and a TOTP engine shared by its CLI and terminal UI.</p>
  <p>D2FA Watch is the first ecosystem extension, with an independently implemented Wear OS companion experience. Desktop-to-watch transfer and additional clients are planned.</p>
  <p>Review the <a href="/docs/security">security model</a> for protection boundaries and recovery responsibilities.</p>
</section>
